From 8d14cacf0cde60348455c438fc53b6d5dfeb42ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miky8745 <vanecek.petr@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:27:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add Optiforge HMD, tracked by a Vive tracker, to the
 lighthouse builder

Also give the XCB compositor window a class, a title and a position hint, so XRT_COMPOSITOR_XCB_DISPLAY works with KWin.

Report devices tracked by libsurvive as not tracked once its poses are more than 100 ms old instead of
predicting from them forever, and fade the screen to white over 0.5 s while the head isn't tracked, like SteamVR.
